1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,830
Ever wondered why handmade costs more?

2
00:00:02,850 --> 00:00:05,634
A machine prints a T-shirt in 8 seconds.

3
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:08,383
This one is stitched, by hand.

4
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:10,580
Printed: seconds.

5
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:12,730
Machine embroidered: minutes.

6
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:15,080
Hand embroidered, hours.

7
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:16,851
One stitch, then the next.

8
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:20,021
By someone with 25 years in her fingers.

9
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:22,248
A machine runs 8 at once.

10
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:23,555
She makes one.

11
00:00:23,950 --> 00:00:26,503
And she is paid fairly, for every hour.

12
00:00:27,050 --> 00:00:28,998
You’re not paying for a T-shirt.

13
00:00:29,050 --> 00:00:30,707
You’re paying for her time.

